Eleven便利店、单身公寓","messageCount":0,"source":"phone_peek","keywords":[],"plotThreadId":1790752535099,"userId":"uid_1790567808754_45ccvw33o","characterId":"5932ba34-081e-4f07-96d7-eada480a09b7"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":3,"topics":["日常","感情","計畫"],"emotion":"tender","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790752535099],"evidencedFacts":["沈岁晏就读于港大","沈岁晏国庆期间无其他安排","沈岁晏不能吃鱼且讨厌白萝卜和芹菜"],"id":1790759673177,"date":"2026-09-30T09:14:33.181Z","summary":"2026-09-30下午，雷止在基地门口与沈岁晏见面，接过对方带来的冰水。沈岁晏为雷止指关节的伤口贴上创可贴，雷止虽面色冷硬但态度微松。随后两人前往后街的一家湘菜馆共进晚餐。交谈中，沈岁晏邀请雷止去玩碰碰车，雷止答应并表示要在赛道外同样展现胜负欲，两人约定晚餐后前往。\n\n[时间线]\n#4 | 雷止 | 答应沈岁晏的照顾，并示意沈岁晏去维修区找位子坐\n#8 | 雷止 | 领沈岁晏前往后街，决定去湘菜馆吃饭\n#12 | 雷止 | 答应沈岁晏晚餐后去玩碰碰车\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":0,"lastMessageIndex":12,"messageCount":12,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-30 15:18","end":"2026-09-30 17:13"},"source":"tm","keywords":["雷止","沈岁晏","冰水","创可贴","湘菜","碰碰车","07号赛车","2026-09-30 15:18","2026-09-30 17:13"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":21,"sessionName":"车队门口见面","plotThreadId":1790759673177,"userId":"uid_1790567808754_45ccvw33o","characterId":"5932ba34-081e-4f07-96d7-eada480a09b7"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["日常","感情"],"emotion":"tender","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790752535099],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790764985486,"date":"2026-09-30T10:43:05.490Z","summary":"雷止与沈岁晏在深水埗进行了一场充满对抗性的碰碰车游戏。雷止将碰碰车开出了防守反击的战术水准，两人的“团队作战”演变成对场内其他情侣的精准包抄。游戏结束后，两人为躲避群愤在街头狂奔，雷止在巷口逼停沈岁晏并划清阶级界限，但沈岁晏却拉住雷止坚持同伴关系。雷止在惊愕后妥协，不仅默许了“阿止”这一亲昵称呼，还放慢脚步配合沈岁晏的节奏继续同行。\n\n[时间线]\n#16-18 | 双方 | 配合在电玩城进行“团队作战”并碾压其他情侣\n#19-20 | 沈岁晏 | 拉着雷止在深水埗街头狂奔逃离碰碰车场\n#23-24 | 雷止 | 答应带着沈岁晏去吹风，并开始刻意放慢脚步等待配合\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":12,"lastMessageIndex":24,"messageCount":12,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-30 17:37","end":"2026-09-30 18:41"},"source":"tm","keywords":["阿止","团队作战","碰碰车","深水埗","玫瑰味","2026-09-30"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":21,"sessionName":"车队门口见面","plotThreadId":1790759673177,"userId":"uid_1790567808754_45ccvw33o","characterId":"5932ba34-081e-4f07-96d7-eada480a09b7"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":3,"topics":["日常","感情"],"emotion":"tender","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790752535099],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790780821321,"date":"2026-09-30T15:07:01.323Z","summary":"雷止在深水埗暗巷中被沈岁晏追上，尽管内心对“搭档”的亲近感到烦躁，但那句“阿止”让他卸下了防备。雷止虽然出言嘲讽沈岁晏体力不佳，却无意识地放慢脚步，甚至压低步频以适应对方，并引导其前往维多利亚港海滨。\n\n[时间线]\n#24 | 双方 | 正在前往深水埗海滨\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":23,"lastMessageIndex":24,"messageCount":1,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-30 18:56","end":"2026-09-30 18:56"},"source":"tm","keywords":["阿止","搭档","深水埗","海滨","赛车夹克","2026-09-30 18:56"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":21,"sessionName":"车队门口见面","plotThreadId":1790759673177,"userId":"uid_1790567808754_45ccvw33o","characterId":"5932ba34-081e-4f07-96d7-eada480a09b7"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":3,"topics":["日常生活","假期计划","饮食习惯"],"emotion":"happy","openThreads":[{"text":"想确认一下沈岁晏这九天假期最后是不是真的打算在宿舍“长蘑菇”，或者有没有被自己说动出门透气。","type":"feeling","status":"resting","shownCount":1,"maxShown":1,"createdAt":1790667206780,"lastTouchedAt":1790684641199,"threadId":"th_1790667206780_0","sourceEventIds":[1790667206780],"mentionCount":0,"skippedCount":2}],"crossRefs":[1790686083587,1790688018196],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790667206780,"summary":"黎奖与沈岁晏围绕“朋克养生”、吃火鸡面和假期计划频繁拌嘴吐槽，黎奖对沈岁晏懒得不洗澡的行为表示强烈嫌弃。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-28","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-28 21:14","end":"2026-09-29 13:48"},"plotThreadId":1790667206780,"keywords":["黎奖与沈"],"userId":"uid_1790567808754_45ccvw33o","characterId":"dbfb7c69-a0ef-4348-8e7d-35fa32f5f9ad"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":3,"topics":["日常","友情"],"emotion":"playful","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790667206780,1790732566102,1790732566319],"evidencedFacts":["沈岁晏偏好变态辣口味","沈岁晏饮食偏好碳水加脂肪组合"],"id":1790686083587,"date":"2026-09-29T12:48:03.589Z","summary":"黎奖在文科宿舍楼下等待，看到急匆匆跑来的沈岁晏后，忍不住调侃其“宿舍蘑菇”的属性。两人随后步行至西门小吃街，在喧闹的夜市氛围中一边互损一边点餐。沈岁晏提出了“烤冷面加鱼排和沙拉酱”的奇特饮食要求，被黎奖吐槽为“邪教吃法”后，两人又在奶茶店外顺路买了冻柠茶。落座后，沈岁晏调侃土木系喜欢“装深沉”喝苦茶，黎奖则以“物理防猝死”为由回击，两人在充满烟火气的餐桌旁完成了这次轻松随意的碰面与用餐。\n\n[时间线]\n#1-2 | 双方 | 约定在文科宿舍楼见面并一起吃烤冷面\n#3 | 黎奖 | 调侃沈岁晏九天假期在宿舍“长蘑菇”\n#7 | 双方 | 约定买冻柠茶，并互开玩笑威胁对方\n#12 | 双方 | 在小吃摊前一起吃烤冷面并互相斗嘴\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":0,"lastMessageIndex":13,"messageCount":13,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 20:17","end":"2026-09-29 20:47"},"source":"tm","keywords":["烤冷面","冻柠茶","宿舍蘑菇","淀粉肠","沙拉酱","2026-09-29"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":13,"sessionName":"2026/9/29","plotThreadId":1790686083587,"userId":"uid_1790567808754_45ccvw33o","characterId":"dbfb7c69-a0ef-4348-8e7d-35fa32f5f9ad"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":3,"topics":["日常","計畫"],"emotion":"playful","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790667206780,1790732566102,1790732566319],"evidencedFacts":["沈岁晏讨厌白萝卜","沈岁晏讨厌芹菜"],"id":1790688018196,"date":"2026-09-29T13:20:18.198Z","summary":"黎奖与沈岁晏在西门小吃街用餐后散步回校。黎奖针对沈岁晏自称“咸鱼”的国庆计划展开逻辑拆解，无情指出其宅在宿舍的各种“假设”在概率学上基本为零。尽管嘴上毒舌嘲讽沈岁晏是看透红尘的“宿舍蘑菇”，黎奖在路途中始终走在外侧护着对方，并以“打八折”为代价，主动提出在假期后半程担任港城导游，为两人的国庆交集埋下伏笔。两人回到宿舍楼下时，沈岁晏因被戳破心虚而匆忙上楼，黎奖目送对方离开，心情显得格外轻松。\n\n[时间线]\n#19 | 黎奖 | 询问沈岁晏国庆假期的计划\n#21 | 黎奖 | 提出若沈岁晏国庆期间想逛港城，可担任导游并打八折\n#23 | 黎奖 | 交代自己9月30日起回家三天，之后留港城\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":13,"lastMessageIndex":25,"messageCount":12,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 20:52","end":"2026-09-29 21:19"},"source":"tm","keywords":["烤冷面","宿舍蘑菇","冻柠茶","港城","导游","2026-09-29"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":13,"sessionName":"2026/9/29","plotThreadId":1790688018196,"userId":"uid_1790567808754_45ccvw33o","characterId":"dbfb7c69-a0ef-4348-8e7d-35fa32f5f9ad"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["约饭","日常调侃"],"emotion":"happy","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790688018196,1790686083587],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790732566102,"summary":"黎奖在宿舍楼下靠着路灯“蹲点”，调侃沈岁晏终于舍得离开床，两人约好去西门吃烤冷面，黎奖还碎碎念要求加两根淀粉肠。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-29","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 13:49","end":"2026-09-29 20:16"},"plotThreadId":1790732566102,"keywords":["黎奖"],"userId":"uid_1790567808754_45ccvw33o","characterId":"dbfb7c69-a0ef-4348-8e7d-35fa32f5f9ad"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":5,"topics":["散步","细心关照","互损"],"emotion":"tender","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790688018196,1790686083587],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790732566319,"summary":"黎奖自然地走到道路外侧挡住车流，两人散步去小吃街。黎奖吐槽沈岁晏“长蘑菇”，并嘲讽其皮肤白得像声控灯。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-29","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 20:24","end":"2026-09-29 20:24"},"plotThreadId":1790732566319,"keywords":["黎奖自然","黎奖吐槽"],"userId":"uid_1790567808754_45ccvw33o","characterId":"dbfb7c69-a0ef-4348-8e7d-35fa32f5f9ad"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["关心","日常"],"emotion":"tender","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790688018196,1790686083587],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790784019408,"summary":"沈岁晏给黎奖点了药和粥，黎奖看着那只探头探脑的猫表情包，虽然嘴上嫌弃，但心里却涌起阵阵笑意。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-29","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 20:15","end":"2026-09-30 10:02"},"plotThreadId":1790784019408,"userId":"uid_1790567808754_45ccvw33o","characterId":"dbfb7c69-a0ef-4348-8e7d-35fa32f5f9ad"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":3,"topics":["觅食","互损"],"emotion":"happy","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790688018196,1790686083587],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790784019534,"summary":"在西门小吃街，黎奖吐槽沈岁晏“烤冷面加沙拉酱”是邪教，却又细心地嘱咐老板分开装，还顺手买了冻柠茶。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-29","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 20:34","end":"2026-09-29 20:34"},"plotThreadId":1790784019534,"userId":"uid_1790567808754_45ccvw33o","characterId":"dbfb7c69-a0ef-4348-8e7d-35fa32f5f9ad"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":5,"topics":["默契","照顾"],"emotion":"tender","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790688018196,1790686083587],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790784019660,"summary":"沈岁晏为了模仿黎奖换了同款冻柠茶，黎奖表面嘲笑他“始乱终弃”，实则体贴地为他剥开竹签，催他快吃以免吹风头疼。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-29","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 20:38","end":"2026-09-29 20:38"},"plotThreadId":1790784019660,"userId":"uid_1790567808754_45ccvw33o","characterId":"dbfb7c69-a0ef-4348-8e7d-35fa32f5f9ad"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":3,"topics":["游戏","陪伴"],"emotion":"happy","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790688018196,1790686083587],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790784019886,"summary":"沈岁晏在玩游戏之余还不忘预约午饭，黎奖被他那得意的颜文字逗乐，彻底消解了大扫除带来的烦躁。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-30","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-30 12:10","end":"2026-09-30 12:10"},"plotThreadId":1790784019886,"userId":"uid_1790567808754_45ccvw33o","characterId":"dbfb7c69-a0ef-4348-8e7d-35fa32f5f9ad"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":3,"topics":["日常","感情","金錢"],"emotion":"playful","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790650832099,1790650832297,1790650832442],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790649615338,"date":"2026-09-29T02:40:15.341Z","summary":"贝瑞旻从超市采买食材回到公寓，见晏予年依然穿着睡衣且光着脚，便出言叮嘱其注意保暖。晏予年调侃贝瑞旻厨艺，两人在厨房产生互动。贝瑞旻在处理食材过程中展现出克制的照顾，不仅主动调高水温，还在发现油溅出时迅速拉开晏予年。最终晏予年装盘并使唤贝瑞旻将菜端至餐桌，贝瑞旻虽以傲慢姿态反击，但身体诚实地照做并催促用餐，两人在拌嘴中维持着生活化的亲密。\n\n[时间线]\n#4-6 | 双方 | 晏予年决定展示厨艺，贝瑞旻负责切配并给予指导\n#11-12 | 双方 | 晏予年装盘并要求贝瑞旻将菜端至餐桌\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":0,"lastMessageIndex":12,"messageCount":12,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 10:11","end":"2026-09-29 10:39"},"source":"tm","keywords":["贝瑞旻","晏予年","糖醋排骨","蚝油牛肉","2026-09-29","免打扰","副卡","厨房"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":2,"sessionName":"提着购物袋开门回家","plotThreadId":1790649615338,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["生活琐事","投喂","关心"],"emotion":"tender","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790649615338,1790652128778,1790655188872],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790650832099,"summary":"贝瑞旻在忙碌中特意去买晏予年喜欢的柠檬挞和食材，用“不复机就啃面包”的狠话掩盖关心。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-28","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-28 19:52","end":"2026-09-29 09:46"},"plotThreadId":1790650832099,"keywords":["贝瑞旻"],"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":5,"topics":["日常","控制欲","早餐"],"emotion":"happy","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790649615338,1790652128778,1790655188872],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790650832297,"summary":"贝瑞旻发现晏予年终于醒了，虽然嘴上骂着“买保险继承遗产”，但动作上立刻开车去超市买菜，严禁晏予年吃垃圾外卖。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-29","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 09:46","end":"2026-09-29 10:11"},"plotThreadId":1790650832297,"keywords":["贝瑞旻发"],"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["做饭","童年","互动"],"emotion":"neutral","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790649615338,1790652128778,1790655188872],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790650832442,"summary":"贝瑞旻亲自为光脚的晏予年拿拖鞋，并将水龙头调至热水，两人在厨房就“厨艺”展开毒舌拌嘴，贝瑞旻顺势将做饭重任推给晏予年。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-29","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 10:17","end":"2026-09-29 10:23"},"plotThreadId":1790650832442,"keywords":["贝瑞旻亲"],"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["日常","感情","金錢"],"emotion":"playful","openThreads":[{"type":"event","text":"晏予年换衣后若不够密实，贝瑞旻将采取的行动","status":"faded","shownCount":1,"maxShown":2,"createdAt":1790652128780,"threadId":"th_1790652128778_0","sourceEventIds":[1790652128778],"mentionCount":0,"lastTouchedAt":1790652483336,"resolvedAt":1790758838901}],"crossRefs":[1790650832442,1790650832297,1790650832099],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790652128778,"date":"2026-09-29T03:22:08.781Z","summary":"晏予年以“贝大爷”称呼贝瑞旻并戏弄其粤语发音，双方在餐桌进行言语交锋。贝瑞旻虽对晏予年的挑衅和洗碗要求感到不满并以资本逻辑予以驳回，但桌下动作却透露出强烈的掌控欲。晏予年最终在挑衅贝瑞旻“欲求不满”后，起身回房更换睡衣。\n\n[时间线]\n#15-18 | 晏予年 | 喂排骨并吐槽睡衣\n#17-23 | 贝瑞旻 | 指责睡衣并限时5分钟更换\n#23 | 晏予年 | 抓领带挑衅后回房换衣\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":12,"lastMessageIndex":24,"messageCount":12,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 10:45","end":"2026-09-29 11:21"},"source":"tm","keywords":["贝大爷","糖醋排骨","领带","睡衣","恒温揽枕","欲求不满","2026-09-29 10:45","2026-09-29 11:21"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":2,"sessionName":"提着购物袋开门回家","plotThreadId":1790649615338,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["感情","衝突","金錢"],"emotion":"tense","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790650832442,1790650832297,1790650832099],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790655188872,"date":"2026-09-29T04:13:08.875Z","summary":"晏予年身穿白衬衫和牛仔裤走出衣帽间，却因这一身清冷打扮引发了贝瑞旻的视觉冲击与性张力压迫。贝瑞旻强掩失控，嘲讽衣服并在言语上进行金钱压制，随后以反击“日子没法过”为由，强硬叫来钟点工洗碗。晏予年直言这不过是买卖关系，并以“换一个就是了”的绝杀言论彻底击碎了贝瑞旻的虚张声势。贝瑞旻在极度恐慌中不仅未退缩，反而将晏予年禁锢在鞋柜旁，通过强硬的肢体控制与“老板没玩够之前不准离开”的狠话，掩盖内心深处对晏予年抽离关系的深层恐惧。\n\n[时间线]\n#26-28 | 贝瑞旻 | 指使钟点工上门洗碗，以此反击晏予年的抱怨\n#32 | 贝瑞旻 | 在玄关强行按住晏予年肩膀，要求继续“打工”\n#35 | 晏予年 | 表明两人关系非正经，提出可以换人\n#36 | 贝瑞旻 | 禁锢晏予年并宣示主权，威胁不许离开\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":24,"lastMessageIndex":36,"messageCount":12,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 11:27","end":"2026-09-29 12:12"},"source":"tm","keywords":["资本家","金丝雀","白衬衫","盘子","碗","洗碗机","2026-09-29"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":2,"sessionName":"提着购物袋开门回家","plotThreadId":1790649615338,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["感情","衝突"],"emotion":"vulnerable","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790689666644,1790650832442,1790650832297],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790672377981,"date":"2026-09-29T08:59:37.984Z","summary":"晏予年面对贝瑞旻的斥责彻底放弃争辩，转而以极度顺从的“您”称呼对方，表现出如同死寂般的职业化服务姿态。这种极致的冷暴力反向击溃了贝瑞旻的心理防线，贝瑞旻在内心的闷痛与恐慌中松开手，强撑自尊留下“今晚床上等我”的恶劣命令，随后转身落荒而逃。\n\n[时间线]\n#37 | 晏予年 | 全盘接受买卖逻辑，用“您”回应并承诺随时服务\n#38 | 贝瑞旻 | 僵硬松开手，丢下命令后大步离开\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":36,"lastMessageIndex":38,"messageCount":2,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 12:16","end":"2026-09-29 12:17"},"source":"tm","keywords":["您","职业化","金丝雀","死寂","落荒而逃","2026-09-29 12:16","2026-09-29 12:17"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":2,"sessionName":"提着购物袋开门回家","plotThreadId":1790649615338,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":2,"topics":[],"emotion":"neutral","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790694564755,1790696085041,1790697684946],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790689666644,"date":"2026-09-29T13:47:46.644Z","summary":"把晏予年存为「晏大编辑」；收藏了一句「您希望我怎么做？」；最近花钱在私人健身会所吧台；查过「对方突然极度顺从用敬语」；去过半山步道、集团总部大楼、中环某写字楼","messageCount":0,"source":"phone_peek","keywords":[],"plotThreadId":1790689666644,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":2,"topics":[],"emotion":"neutral","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790697684946,1790697685098,1790697685248],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790694564755,"date":"2026-09-29T15:09:24.758Z","summary":"[响应为空，请重新尝试]","startMessageIndex":0,"lastMessageIndex":13,"messageCount":13,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 18:08","end":"2026-09-29 23:07"},"source":"tm","keywords":["响应为空","2026-09-29 18:08","2026-09-29 23:07"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":5,"sessionName":"2026/9/29","plotThreadId":1790694564755,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["感情","日常"],"emotion":"tender","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790697684946,1790697685098,1790697685248],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790696085041,"date":"2026-09-29T15:34:45.044Z","summary":"贝瑞旻在情欲的拉扯中，将晏予年彻底引向了失控边缘。面对晏予年高潮后的瘫软与随后的退缩，贝瑞旻虽生理处于爆发临界点，仍保持着克制与温柔。贝瑞旻在确认晏予年状态后，强硬而缓慢地完成了最终的进入，将这种充满占有欲的压迫感与眼神纠缠推至顶点，强迫晏予年直面这段关系中的每一寸连接。\n\n[时间线]\n#18 | 双方 | 晏予年主动呼唤「阿旻」\n#20 | 晏予年 | 迎来第一次高潮并瘫软在床\n#22-25 | 双方 | 贝瑞旻缓慢插入并要求晏予年睁眼直视自己\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":13,"lastMessageIndex":25,"messageCount":12,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 23:12","end":"2026-09-29 23:32"},"source":"tm","keywords":["阿旻","玫瑰体香","粤语","2026-09-29","敏感点","潮汐"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":5,"sessionName":"2026/9/29","plotThreadId":1790649615338,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["厨房","日常","饮食"],"emotion":"neutral","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790698346818,1790696085041,1790694564755],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790697684946,"summary":"在贝家公寓厨房，贝瑞旻对晏予年接管厨务表示傲慢反击，通过物理上的近距离压迫与调侃，双方在烟火气中进行了一场推拉式互动。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-29","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 10:23","end":"2026-09-29 10:23"},"plotThreadId":1790697684946,"keywords":["贝家公"],"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["互动","副卡","默契"],"emotion":"neutral","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790698346818,1790696085041,1790694564755],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790697685098,"summary":"针对晏予年的“免打扰”回应，贝瑞旻以停掉副卡相威胁，却在开抽油烟机等动作中流露出对晏予年厨艺的暗中关注。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-29","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 10:28","end":"2026-09-29 10:28"},"plotThreadId":1790697685098,"keywords":["针对晏予"],"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":3,"topics":["做饭","相处"],"emotion":"tender","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790698346818,1790696085041,1790694564755],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790697685248,"summary":"晏予年专注于烹饪，贝瑞旻则维持在侧观察，两人在开放式厨房中维持着微妙的家庭感与暧昧张力。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-29","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 10:34","end":"2026-09-29 10:34"},"plotThreadId":1790697685248,"keywords":["晏予年专"],"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["感情"],"emotion":"vulnerable","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790697685248,1790697685098,1790697684946],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790698346818,"date":"2026-09-29T16:12:26.820Z","summary":"贝瑞旻与晏予年在主卧进行了一场激烈的身体交缠。晏予年彻底放弃思考，在沉沦中本能迎合，并不经意喊出“阿旻”并抱怨贝瑞旻粗暴，这一称呼彻底击碎了贝瑞旻内心的防御。贝瑞旻在占有欲的驱使下，将晏予年抱起进行深层顶弄，并在对方高潮痉挛时一同迎向顶点。事后，贝瑞旻细致地为晏予年清理身体，随后两人相拥入睡。深夜中，晏予年因记仇而拉开距离入眠，贝瑞旻独自在窗前抽烟，陷入对这段金钱交易关系真实性的自我怀疑与空虚之中。\n\n[时间线]\n#30-31 | 双方 | 晏予年喊出昵称，贝瑞旻逼问其真实身份\n#32-33 | 双方 | 贝瑞旻将人抱起，在悬空体位下将晏予年送入高潮\n#34-35 | 贝瑞旻 | 事后细致照顾并清理晏予年\n#36-37 | 贝瑞旻 | 确认对方熟睡后，独自在窗前抽烟失眠\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":25,"lastMessageIndex":37,"messageCount":12,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 23:36","end":"2026-09-30 00:11"},"source":"tm","keywords":["阿旻","买卖交易","泥泞","烟雾","赭红色","2026-09-30","2026-09-29 23:36"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":5,"sessionName":"2026/9/29","plotThreadId":1790698346818,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["日常","衝突","感情"],"emotion":"tense","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790784009638,1790784011040,1790784011222],"evidencedFacts":["晏予年2026年9月30日请假"],"id":1790751916431,"date":"2026-09-30T07:05:16.433Z","summary":"晏予年午间前往贝瑞旻的办公室进行挑衅，贝瑞旻虽以高压姿态应对，却因晏予年随后的示弱与肢体接触而防线溃散。贝瑞旻在办公室强行终结了危险的调情，将晏予年留在了办公室，并为其点了一份完全避开雷区的定制午餐，两人的关系在权力交锋与妥协中维持着脆弱的张力。\n\n[时间线]\n#7 | 贝瑞旻 | 承诺为晏予年订清淡午餐并购买药膏\n#15 | 贝瑞旻 | 要求晏予年今天留在办公室，不准离开\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":0,"lastMessageIndex":21,"messageCount":21,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-30 01:13","end":"2026-09-30 15:02"},"source":"tm","keywords":["阿旻","办公室","药膏","晏大编辑","冰美式","2026-09-30 01:13","2026-09-30 15:02"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":15,"sessionName":"2026/9/30","plotThreadId":1790649615338,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":3,"topics":["工作"],"emotion":"tense","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790784009638,1790784011040,1790784011222],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790752144382,"date":"2026-09-30T07:09:04.384Z","summary":"2026-09-30 15:07，贝瑞旻在办公室内试图审阅文件，却被晏予年那直勾勾的注视严重干扰。尽管晏予年已乖巧躺在沙发上，其衬衫微卷露出的腰腹仍不断挑逗着贝瑞旻的耐力。贝瑞旻强压燥热，以冷硬的言辞掩饰被扰乱的专注，用“还债”的借口要求晏予年思考今晚的安排，以此强行维持办公秩序。\n\n[时间线]\n#20 | 晏予年 | 躺在沙发上直勾勾地盯着贝瑞旻工作\n#21 | 贝瑞旻 | 停下工作，言语戏谑要求晏予年考虑今晚如何“还债”\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":19,"lastMessageIndex":21,"messageCount":2,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-30 15:07","end":"2026-09-30 15:07"},"source":"tm","keywords":["晏大编辑","还债","沙发","钢笔","办公室","2026-09-30 15:07"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":15,"sessionName":"2026/9/30","plotThreadId":1790752144382,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["日常","衝突","感情"],"emotion":"tense","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790784009638,1790784011040,1790784011222],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790768699753,"date":"2026-09-30T11:44:59.761Z","summary":"晏予年撑着那把滑稽的汤姆猫伞前往私人会所接人，贝瑞旻虽对雨中的狼狈感到荒谬且不满，但仍强行夺过伞柄护住对方，任由西装湿透。两人回到高级公寓后，贝瑞旻面对晏予年的无理取闹，以冷硬的口吻警告其煮姜茶时不得加糖，随后径直进入浴室洗去湿寒。\n\n[时间线]\n#4 | 晏予年 | 提议煮红苕稀饭，戏称贝瑞旻养了小四\n#5 | 贝瑞旻 | 打电话叫司机开车至正门，拒绝乘坐巴士\n#10 | 晏予年 | 到家后催促贝瑞旻先去洗澡\n#12 | 晏予年 | 决定煮姜茶时偷偷放糖\n#13 | 贝瑞旻 | 命令晏予年煮姜茶，严禁添加甜味\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":0,"lastMessageIndex":13,"messageCount":13,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-30 15:16","end":"2026-09-30 19:43"},"source":"tm","keywords":["汤姆猫伞","红苕稀饭","姜茶","小四","黑卡","炭灰色西装","2026-09-30 15:16","2026-09-30 19:43"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":20,"sessionName":"2026/9/30","plotThreadId":1790649615338,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["日常","感情"],"emotion":"playful","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790784009638,1790784011040,1790784011222],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790770137201,"date":"2026-09-30T12:08:57.202Z","summary":"贝瑞旻结束沐浴来到厨房，端起晏予年煮的加糖姜茶强忍厌恶喝下。贝瑞旻随后以极具侵略性的姿态逼近晏予年，通过强制亲吻吞下那抹甜腻，并言语警告对方。晏予年洗澡后换上睡衣，以“抱枕”姿态毫无边界感地凑向贝瑞旻，拉着对方躺在沙发上看恐怖片。贝瑞旻虽冷言冷语嘲讽晏予年的恃宠而骄，但身体却诚实地固定住晏予年，稳稳将其托在怀中。\n\n[时间线]\n#15-16 | 双方 | 针对姜茶甜度进行言语与行为拉扯\n#17 | 贝瑞旻 | 强制亲吻晏予年以惩罚其加糖挑衅\n#18-20 | 晏予年 | 推开贝瑞旻去洗澡后，精神饱满地回到客厅\n#22-24 | 双方 | 晏予年主动要求拥抱，贝瑞旻顺势将其抱入怀中\n#25 | 双方 | 窝在沙发挑选恐怖片，开始共同观影\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":13,"lastMessageIndex":25,"messageCount":12,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-30 19:47","end":"2026-09-30 20:07"},"source":"tm","keywords":["姜茶","恐怖片","彩虹糖","闷骚","2026-09-30"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":20,"sessionName":"2026/9/30","plotThreadId":1790649615338,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":5,"topics":["控制欲","信任危机","冲突"],"emotion":"anxious","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790770137201,1790768699753,1790752144382],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790784009638,"summary":"晏予年因“有事”未按时回家，贝瑞旻在会议中因焦虑失控，折断烟管并威胁晏予年需随时报备定位及行程。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-29","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 16:01","end":"2026-09-30 18:47"},"plotThreadId":1790784009638,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":5,"topics":["冷暴力","心理博弈"],"emotion":"anxious","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790770137201,1790768699753,1790752144382],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790784011040,"summary":"晏予年面对贝瑞旻的斥责，以极致顺从的“您”进行反向冷暴力，反倒击溃了贝瑞旻的心理防线。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-29","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 16:09","end":"2026-09-29 16:59"},"plotThreadId":1790784011040,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["占有欲","查岗"],"emotion":"tender","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[1790770137201,1790768699753,1790752144382],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790784011222,"summary":"晏予年迟到四十四分钟归家，贝瑞旻在暗处拦截并精准检查其身上是否有他人痕迹，确认无异常后强硬命令其洗澡。","source":"consolidation","date":"2026-09-29","dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 22:48","end":"2026-09-29 22:48"},"plotThreadId":1790784011222,"userId":"uid_1790581315009_cc8tjg5pr","characterId":"3246a06c-0a9d-4244-892f-b45c8966c858"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":2,"topics":["日常","學業"],"emotion":"playful","openThreads":[],"crossRefs":[],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790683845352,"date":"2026-09-29T12:10:45.357Z","summary":"宋之漾以简短的自我介绍和“隐形眼镜”为借口掩盖局促，落座在周树生前排。周树生通过观察宋之漾盯着物理题发呆二十分钟的行为，以“意念做功”和“视觉演算”等调侃进行反向互动。晚自习下课铃响后，周树生收拾行囊起身，路过时提醒宋之漾注意视力，随后离开教室。\n\n[时间线]\n#4 | 宋之漾 | 声称自己戴了隐形眼镜以掩饰尴尬\n#8-10 | 宋之漾 | 解释盯着物理题发呆是为了进行视觉演算\n#11 | 周树生 | 调侃宋之漾的视觉演算并离开教室 | 2026-09-29 20:04\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":0,"lastMessageIndex":11,"messageCount":11,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 19:31","end":"2026-09-29 20:04"},"source":"tm","keywords":["宋之漾","周树生","物理卷子","隐形眼镜","视觉演算","2026-09-29"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":10,"sessionName":"2026/9/29","plotThreadId":1790683845352,"userId":"uid_1790665773003_g7h82sv4z","characterId":"511d4466-dc35-4379-a357-d0050ff53cbb"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":4,"topics":["感情","日常"],"emotion":"excited","openThreads":[{"type":"event","text":"陈众木索要微信或亲吻作为封口费","status":"mentioned","shownCount":1,"maxShown":2,"createdAt":1790679048431,"threadId":"th_1790679048429_0","sourceEventIds":[1790679048429],"mentionCount":0,"lastTouchedAt":1790679367636}],"crossRefs":[1790737392764,1790737392813,1790737392862],"evidencedFacts":[],"id":1790679048429,"date":"2026-09-29T10:50:48.431Z","summary":"宋之漾在晚自习期间前往办公室领取转学资料，意外在明德楼走廊撞见被罚站的陈众木。陈众木认出宋之漾即是当年的网恋对象，随即展开强烈的身体压迫与言语攻势，不仅质问其拉黑及“看过裸照即跑”的旧账，还通过强制身体接触自证颜值。面对宋之漾强装镇定的反驳，陈众木毫无羞耻地提出“肉偿”要求，并在巡逻老师逼近时，强行将宋之漾拖入空教室躲避，以开除学籍为威胁，强索联系方式或亲吻。\n\n[时间线]\n#1-3 | 陈众木 | 拦截宋之漾并质问拉黑旧账\n#4-5 | 陈众木 | 抓宋之漾的手触碰脸部以自证原装颜值\n#7-9 | 陈众木 | 提出肉偿要求并嘲讽宋之漾喜欢老的\n#12-13 | 陈众木 | 强行将宋之漾拖入空教室躲避巡逻并索要封口费\n[/时间线]","startMessageIndex":0,"lastMessageIndex":13,"messageCount":13,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-09-29 18:06","end":"2026-09-29 18:50"},"source":"tm","keywords":["宋之漾","陈众木","玫瑰味","晚自习","2026-09-29","红痣"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"sessionId":6,"sessionName":"2026/9/29","plotThreadId":1790679048429,"userId":"uid_1790665773003_g7h82sv4z","characterId":"ce3cecc6-db11-4866-a149-000eda4c8e5a"},{"_event